    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**Range selection** shortcuts let you highlight entire blocks of data in seconds: `Ctrl+Shift+↓` extends down to the last filled cell, `Ctrl+Shift+→` extends across columns, and `Shift+PageDown` extends down one screen. On a Mac, use `⌘` instead of `Ctrl` (such as `⌘⇧↓`). Empty rows stop the selection early."
    },
